WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:03.146
Suppose the visitor presses submit twice because the

00:00:03.204 --> 00:00:04.191
network was slow.

00:00:04.574 --> 00:00:07.872
Without a design for duplicates, the owner may receive two

00:00:07.964 --> 00:00:08.522
records.

00:00:08.963 --> 00:00:12.283
Idempotency means repeating the same operation safely

00:00:12.608 --> 00:00:14.780
without duplicating its intended effect.

00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:17.334
There are different ways to achieve it, and the right

00:00:17.357 --> 00:00:18.809
approach depends on the system.

00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:22.152
The architecture should name the problem, the proposed

00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:25.716
identity or retry rule, and how the system reconciles an

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:28.689
uncertain result before doing the operation again.
